# The CP/1 corpus and manifest are byte-exact artifacts: every binding hashes
# these files and compares against MANIFEST.sha256. A checkout that translated
# line endings would append \r to every corpus line, and the conformance suite
# would report a canonical-encoding failure for what is actually a checkout
# setting. Pin them to LF on every platform.
cp1/fixtures/canonical.jsonl -text eol=lf
cp1/MANIFEST.sha256          -text eol=lf
cp1/SPEC.md                  -text eol=lf
cp1/schema/cp1.schema.json   -text eol=lf
cp1/VERSION                  -text eol=lf
